<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JAN JOBLESS DATA DUE FEB 14 0830 - MINISTRY.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JAN JOBLESS DATA DUE FEB 14 0830 - MINISTRY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The labour ministry said in a statement on Wednesday that its January employment report will be released on Frioday, February 14 at 0830/0630 GMT.  </p>
<p>The mean of six economists' forecasts for the January unemployment rate calculated by the ministry is 18.6 percent (range 18.5-18.8 pct), down from 19.0 percent in December.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
